    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate sampling-standardized global diversity, origination, and extinction rates across later geological intervals. Test whether long-run net diversification is near zero and whether origination covaries with losses, while separating balance from causation.";
